@startuml sequence_diagram_get
skinparam handwritten true
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rect
skinparam defaultFontName FG Virgil
skinparam shadowing false

actor User as Actor
participant "UI Pages" as UI <<presentation>>
participant "UI XptoService" as UiService <<service>>
participant "UI XptoModel" as UiModel <<model>>
participant API as API <<application>>
participant XptoController as Controller <<controller>>
participant XptoService as Service <<service>>
participant XptoRepository as Repository <<repository>>
participant XptoContext as Context <<context>>
database Database

title Read Xpto

Actor --> UI: Read Xpto
activate UI

    UI --> UiService: getXpto(id)
    activate UiService

        UiService --> API: HTTP GET /api/xpto/{id}

        activate API

            alt Check authorization diagram
                API --> Controller: route
            end
            activate Controller

                Controller --> Service: Request read
                activate Service

                    Service --> Repository: GetXpto(id)
                    activate Repository
                    
                        Repository --> Context: Get(id)
                        activate Context
                            Context --> Database: SELECT
                            Context --> Repository: result
                        deactivate Context

                        Repository --> Service: xptoInstance
                    deactivate Repository

                    Service --> Model: toDto()
                    activate Model
                        Model --> Service: xptoInstanceDto
                    deactivate Model

                    Service --> Controller: xptoInstanceDto
                deactivate Service

                Controller --> API: Ok(xptoResponseDto)
            deactivate Controller

            API --> UiService: HTTP Response

        deactivate API

        UiService --> UI: xpto details
    deactivate UiService

UI --> Actor: Show Xpto details
deactivate UI

@enduml
